<title>SOUTH KOREA: S.Korean millers buy 35,000T Argentine feed wheat.</title>
<headline>S.Korean millers buy 35,000T Argentine feed wheat.</headline>
<dateline>SEOUL 1997-04-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>South Korean feed milling companies on Thursday jointly bought 35,000 tonnes of Argentine feed wheat at $143 a tonne C&amp;F, traders said.  </p>
<p>They said the purchase was made from Daewoo Corp through a private negotiation for April 15-May 15 shipment.</p>
<p>Arrival was set to the South Korean ports of Inchon and Ulsan.</p>
<p>-- Seoul Newsroom (822) 727 5651</p>
</text>
